 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "I find a mistake in my last commit. I compare the working tree with my notes. Priya and I look for a detail in the staged change. It takes me ten minutes to amend a commit. After I revert a commit, I tell the team. Priya starts with \"The sink is leaking.\" and I continue with \"The light isn't working.\" I write down what I learned today.",
   "tts": "I find a mistake in my last commit. I compare the working tree with my notes. Priya and I look for a detail in the staged change. It takes me ten minutes to amend a commit. After I revert a commit, I tell the team. Priya starts with \"The sink is leaking.\" and I continue with \"The light isn't working.\" I write down what I learned today.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "我发现上次提交里有个错误。我把工作树和我的笔记做了比较。Priya 和我在已暂存改动里找一个细节。我花了十分钟修改最近提交。我还原提交之后，告诉了团队。Priya先说了\"水槽漏水了。\"我接着说：\"灯不亮了。\"我记下了今天学到的东西。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "working tree",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "工作树，当前检出的项目文件状态"
    },
    {
     "w": "staged change",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "已暂存改动，准备进入下一次提交的变化"
    },
    {
     "w": "The sink is leaking.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "水槽漏水了。"
    },
    {
     "w": "The light isn't working.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "灯不亮了。"
    },
    {
     "w": "amend a commit",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "修改最近提交，补充或更正最后一次提交"
    },
    {
     "w": "revert a commit",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "还原提交，用新提交抵消旧提交的改动"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "The sink at home is leaking. I call for help. When we meet, Leo says, \"Could someone repair it?\" I reply, \"When can the technician come?\" After lunch, I check the unstaged change again. Before the meeting, I review the tracked file one more time. I reset a branch so the team can see the change. Before I discard changes, I read the note. With the team's help, the problem becomes smaller.",
   "tts": "The sink at home is leaking. I call for help. When we meet, Leo says, \"Could someone repair it?\" I reply, \"When can the technician come?\" After lunch, I check the unstaged change again. Before the meeting, I review the tracked file one more time. I reset a branch so the team can see the change. Before I discard changes, I read the note. With the team's help, the problem becomes smaller.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "家里的水槽漏水了。我打电话求助。见面时，Leo说：\"可以派人来修吗？\"我回答：\"维修人员什么时候能来？\"午饭后，我又检查了一遍未暂存改动。开会前，我又复习了一遍已跟踪文件。我重置分支，好让团队看到变化。在丢弃改动之前，我先看了说明。在团队的帮助下，问题变小了。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "unstaged change",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "未暂存改动，尚未加入提交区的变化"
    },
    {
     "w": "tracked file",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "已跟踪文件，Git 已经纳入版本管理的文件"
    },
    {
     "w": "Could someone repair it?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "可以派人来修吗？"
    },
    {
     "w": "When can the technician come?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "维修人员什么时候能来？"
    },
    {
     "w": "reset a branch",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "重置分支，把分支指针移到另一提交"
    },
    {
     "w": "discard changes",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "丢弃改动，放弃尚未保存的文件变化"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I review what I did today. When I restore a file, I follow the guide. Priya and I look for a detail in the force push. After lunch, I check the untracked file again. Before the meeting, I review the clean state one more time. Priya starts with \"The problem is getting worse.\" and I continue with \"It's working again now.\" I revert the commit and make a clean one. The history is safe.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I review what I did today. When I restore a file, I follow the guide. Priya and I look for a detail in the force push. After lunch, I check the untracked file again. Before the meeting, I review the clean state one more time. Priya starts with \"The problem is getting worse.\" and I continue with \"It's working again now.\" I revert the commit and make a clean one. The history is safe.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我回顾了今天做的事。我恢复文件时，按照指南操作。Priya 和我在强制推送里找一个细节。午饭后，我又检查了一遍未跟踪文件。开会前，我又复习了一遍干净状态。Priya先说了\"问题越来越严重。\"我接着说：\"现在又能用了。\"我还原了那次提交，重新做了一个干净的提交。历史是安全的。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "untracked file",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "未跟踪文件，Git 尚未纳入版本管理的新文件"
    },
    {
     "w": "clean state",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "干净状态，工作区没有未提交变化的状态"
    },
    {
     "w": "The problem is getting worse.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "问题越来越严重。"
    },
    {
     "w": "It's working again now.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "现在又能用了。"
    },
    {
     "w": "restore a file",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "恢复文件，把文件恢复到指定状态"
    },
    {
     "w": "force push",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "强制推送，用本地历史覆盖远程分支历史"
    }
   ]
  }
